  "critical": false,
  "description": "Glass-to-metal seals for hermetic electrical feedthroughs, vacuum tube envelopes, and semiconductor device packages. Matched seals (Kovar alloy to borosilicate glass, CTE ~5×10⁻⁶/°C), unmatched compression seals (steel to soda-lime glass), and fritted seals using glass powder preforms. Enables vacuum tubes, transistor packages, feedthrough connectors, and sensor housings.",
